+    Per-idea token counts are wanted for cost accounting, and the OpenAI
+    chat-completions shape this gateway speaks defines a ``usage`` block —
+    but whether *this* deployment populates it can only be settled by
+    looking at a live response. So: if it is there we forward it; if it is
+    not, we say what WAS there, once, and stop. Deliberately no
